    "acceptanceResults": [
      "Provider facts are imported as original delegated evidence with raw-byte digest, repository/Work Item/source/time/assurance bindings; SelfDeclared is never upgraded to ProviderVerified and no provider API client is added.",
      "The validation binds H0→H1 and the M1 merge commit parents exactly to M0 and H1, allows M0 not to be an H1 ancestor, requires current main to contain M1, and validates fixed pairwise tree changes without relying on a three-dot comparison.",
